00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,595
Learn science by teaching Dekisugi-kun.

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:06,669
Predict first. Then read the principle and its conditions.

3
00:00:06,749 --> 00:00:09,181
Here, air resistance must be negligible.

4
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:13,081
Now, hide the material and teach it back.

5
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:16,263
I explain in my own words.

6
00:00:16,343 --> 00:00:21,633
Text is a full route, alongside voice. Student explanations stay on the device.

7
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:28,591
I reread my explanation. Key terms prompt reflection, not a mastery score.

8
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:31,972
A fixed follow-up asks me to apply the idea.

9
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:35,443
A wrong choice brings a hint about the vacuum condition.

10
00:00:35,523 --> 00:00:38,040
I rethink my explanation and try again.

11
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:42,365
Uncertain ideas stay in the record for review.

